  "html": "\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"black\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"20\" valign=\"middle\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"#FF6633\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;Decoration</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F1F1F1\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"575\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>데코레이션 설명</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/decoration/images/deco/knitting.gif\" width=\"28\"></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"#990066\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">데코레이션 도구(집장식도구) : 이제는 간편하게 테코레이션툴을 \n\n                        이용하여 \n\n                        아이템을 회전시키거나 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"#990066\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">공중으로 띄울 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"120\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"120\" src=\"/img/posts/site/decoration/images/deco/basic/tool.gif\" width=\"120\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F1F1F1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"460\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>1</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">. \n\n                        마을 목공소[톱그림간판]에서 인테리어툴을 \n                        구입하실 \n\n                        수 있습니다.</span></font> </p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가격은 \n\n                        약 1만원정도로 영구적으로 사용하실 수 \n                        있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/decoration/images/deco/line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"1\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"580\"></span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"120\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"120\" src=\"/img/posts/site/decoration/images/deco/basic/tool_1.gif\" width=\"120\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F1F1F1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"460\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>2</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">. \n\n                        인테리어툴을 더블클릭 후 타겟이 뜨면 인테리어툴을 \n\n                        다시 타겟을 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">클릭해줍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측의 \n\n                        사진과같은 메뉴가 나옵니다 이때 \n\n                        턴,위,아래를 선택해주시면 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">인테리어툴이 \n                        해당설정으로 \n\n                        저장됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">저장된 \n\n                        인테리어툴을 더블클릭후 원하시는 아이템을 \n\n                        찍어주시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/decoration/images/deco/line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"1\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"580\"></span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"15\" width=\"288\">\n<p>&nbsp;<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">[</span></font><a href=\"/site/decoration/deco/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><font color=\"#FF6633\" face=\"Verdana\">Main</font></b></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">]</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p align=\"right\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/decoration/images/b_logo.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"100\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:80%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
